*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

*icc = 72
* DESCRIPTION:   Central Solenoid Tresca yield criterion (i_tf_bucking >=2)
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, don't care about CS stress
* VARIABLES:     sig_tf_cs_bucked ( Maximum shear stress in CS case at flux swing (no current in CS))

*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

*fseppc =  
* DESCRIPTION:   CS separation force held by CS pre-comp structure
* JUSTIFICATION: 

*sigallpc = 
* DESCRIPTION:   Allowable stress in CS pre-comp structure (Pa)
* JUSTIFICATION: 

