*into during scaling (5 - 10 is good)
* JUSTIFICATION: Not yet set.

*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

*icc = 79
* DESCRIPTION:   Constraint equation for maximum CS field
