*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

*icc = 27
* DESCRIPTION:   Constraint equation for CS current density upper limit at BOP 
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, don't care about CS current density limit 
