*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

*icc = 60
* DESCRIPTION:   Constraint equation for Central Solenoid s/c temperature margin lower limit
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, do not care about temp lower limit 
